# Drop Kerberos keytabs here.
#
# The NFS compose service (docker compose --profile nfs) expects
# nfs.keytab in this directory by default — a service keytab for
# nfs/<compose-host-fqdn>@REALM issued by FreeIPA. Get one with:
#
#   ipa-getkeytab -s ipa.realm.example.com \
#                 -p nfs/nfs-host.realm.example.com \
#                 -k /path/on/host/nfs.keytab
#
# Move it into place before bringing the profile up.
